N470 G90
N480 MEAS=1 G1 X30 Y43 Z15 F300
N490 IF $AC_MEA[1]==0
N500 MSG("PROBE NO CONTACT")
N510 SETAL(65000)
N520 M0
N530 ENDIF
N540 G91 G1 X0 Y-1 Z0 F300
N550 G90
