N780 SETAL(65000)
N790 M0
N800 ENDIF
N810 R59=$AA_MW[X]
N820 R60=$AA_MW[Y]
N830 R61=$AA_MW[Z]
N840 G91 G1 X0 Y8 Z0 F300
